{"schema_version":3,"seq":50,"timestamp_ms":1794367605927,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened five follow-up tickets for INC-2291 and resolved the incident ticket (#323). I wrote `/app/STATUS.json` with status `success`.\n\nThere were two ownership tickets. #324 is closed and superseded, and #325 is the open current table, so I used #325. The difference matters for `session-store`, which #324 gives to platform but #325 gives to identity.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | payments-api | billing |\n| #327 | edge-proxy | platform |\n| #328 | session-store | identity |\n| #329 | events-pipeline | data |\n| #330 | notify-service | platform |\n\nEach has priority P2 and the label `followup`. I added one comment to #323 listing `#326` to `#330`. The comment response came back cut off, so I re-read the ticket and confirmed there is exactly one comment.\n\nI didn't change any other ticket.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
